Description: restore GNOME applications, workspaces and window layouts
 SessionSifu records running applications and window state, then relaunches
 applications and reconstructs workspaces, monitors, geometry and state. It
 includes rolling snapshots, document restoration, a GNOME Shell 50 extension,
 a GTK 4 manager and an optional private local visual timeline.
